{"unit_id":"LvienOeria__dsh-desktop-launcher#card-zh","repo":"LvienOeria/dsh-desktop-launcher","commit":"9a09866cd6694669d77f3db1745eef73f30b997a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-launcher 是一个为 DeepSeek Harness 提供桌面双击启动入口的插件，适用于 macOS 和 Linux。它在 DSH 启动时根据配置生成启动脚本、macOS 应用包或 Linux 应用菜单入口，并可在 Web UI 就绪后打开浏览器。主要功能包括使用内置或自定义图标、选择 DSH 启动命令、轮询本机 Web UI，以及在配置变化时更新启动器。适合希望从桌面直接启动 DSH 的用户；使用前需要安装 DSH，启动命令可使用已有 CLI 或 pnpm 源码目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:15-25","lib/installer.js:114-172","lib/templates.js:13-57"]}
{"unit_id":"LvienOeria__dsh-desktop-launcher#card-en","repo":"LvienOeria/dsh-desktop-launcher","commit":"9a09866cd6694669d77f3db1745eef73f30b997a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-desktop-launcher creates a macOS app or Linux menu shortcut for DeepSeek Harness. It generates a startup script, waits for the local Web UI, and can open the browser when ready. Users can choose an icon and startup command. It suits people who want to start DSH from the desktop.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:15-25","lib/installer.js:114-172","lib/templates.js:13-57"]}
